Xenon NetSurf — third-party components
======================================

NetSurf
  This repository is a port/frontend for NetSurf 3.11, which is licensed under
  the GNU General Public License version 2. See LICENSE and
  https://www.netsurf-browser.org/.

minimp3
  Header-only MP3 decoder, CC0 1.0 Universal.
  https://github.com/lieff/minimp3

mbedTLS / mbedtls-xenon
  TLS library, Apache License 2.0. The Xenon port is by xenosworks.
  https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls
  https://github.com/xenosworks/mbedtls-xenon

xsdk
  Xbox 360 homebrew SDK and toolchain support.
  https://github.com/xenosworks/xsdk

CA certificates
  Mozilla's CA bundle as published by curl, MPL 2.0.
  https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html

Linux console font
  The 8x16 glyph data in font8x16.c is derived from the Linux console font,
  GPL-2.0.

OpenH264
  The separate decode benchmark uses OpenH264 2.7.0, BSD-2-Clause.
  https://github.com/cisco/openh264

libpng, zlib, libjpeg, utf8proc, libcss, libdom, libhubbub and the other NetSurf
libraries keep their upstream licences. The prebuilt package includes only
compiled code and the Mozilla CA bundle.

Corresponding source
--------------------
The binary in release/ns360.zip was built from the frontend sources and patch in
this repository, the NetSurf commit and dependency revisions listed in
deps.lock, and the upstream mbedTLS/xsdk trees. The patch and build notes are in
patches/ and docs/BUILDING.md.

`LICENSE` contains the GNU GPL version 2 text. `COPYING` contains NetSurf's
original licence notice, including its OpenSSL linking exception and the MIT
licence for the artwork.
